f30f&oh=00_AQUb1DHWvdoeSEf1UPOds82DF9eLBkFWgD9y-sWGezefmw&oe=6B0F2243"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "trailer-thumb.png", "id": "1396711975683113", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622186_1396711979016446_2293869442483448846_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QRH5yRyyTocQ7kNvwFtD8tD&_nc_oc=Adprn6YbBdHH9afeXPkIDMaS6lzrmV8VmQxYYrUOQMrHDXe6FUTBUSCEqoEZu2K1Ul8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQULzhXIExn9JUEePNiALA0OVKfMimR6cKjGd3e7X2oL6g&oe=6B0F223C"}, "display_name": "No Sleep Till It's Dead", "keywords": ["mosquito", "bug", "insect", "swatter", "bedroom"], "long_description": "Swat, shoot and slice every bug that gets into your bedroom.\n\nNO SLEEP TILL IT'S DEAD\nA whine in your ear. Track it with your eyes, find it by sound, and take it down in one hit.\n\nFIVE KINDS OF TROUBLE\n- Mosquitoes come for your blood\n- Flies go for your dinner\n- Hornets sting, and keep stinging\n- Your sleeping dog needs protecting too\n\nFIVE WAYS TO END IT\nFly swatter, bug-zapper racket, bug spray, laser blade and laser gun. Every wave changes which ones you get.\n\nMORE THAN ONE WAY TO PLAY\n- Campaign: survive 30 nights, carrying your health from one to the next\n- Time Attack: chase the fastest night\n- Free Mode: choose which bugs come, and how many\n\nEASY TO PICK UP. HARD TO SLEEP THROUGH.\nBugs range from 5x size down to real size. A real-size mosquito is genuinely hard to see.\n\nStanding play (2m x 2m). Move with the right thumbstick. For Meta Quest 3 and 3S. English and Japanese.", "short_description": "Swat, shoot and slice every bug that gets into your bedroom."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://no-sleep-till-its-dead.pages.dev/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "\u3042\u3093\u3060\u306a", "support_website_url": "https://no-sleep-till-its-dead.pages.dev/", "website_u